flowchart TB

    USER["🧑 사용자"]

    subgraph DEVICE["사용자 기기"]
        direction TB

        subgraph APP["Electron 앱 〔우창 · codegate-2026-local〕"]
            direction TB
            UI["렌더러 · React/shadcn<br/>3분할 UI · 인용 배지 · diff 승인 모달<br/>execution 폴링 · Undo"]
            MAIN["메인 (Node · 얇게)<br/>sidecar 수명주기 · OAuth 콜백 + safeStorage<br/>폴더 capability · 원본 열기"]
            UI <-->|"IPC"| MAIN
        end

        subgraph SIDE["codegate-local sidecar (Python) 〔성주 · codegate-2026-agent〕 — loopback bind"]
            direction TB
            SDK["Claude Agent SDK<br/>app-owned read tools<br/>❌ 내장 Read/Edit/Write/Bash 비활성<br/>PreToolUse allowlist"]
            WRITE["쓰기 경로 (결정적)<br/>exact diff → plan_hash → 승인<br/>→ backup → atomic replace<br/>→ outbox → Undo"]
            WIKI["LLMWIKI WikiBuildService 〔용휘〕<br/>in-process · CAS build"]
            D2M["doc2md 클라이언트 〔민규〕"]
            SDK --> WRITE
        end

        ROOTS["로컬 디렉터리 (서로 비중첩)<br/>source/ 원본·정본 · source-md/ 정규화 md<br/>llmwiki-storage/ current.json + 불변 builds<br/>app-data/ SQLite · backup · session"]
    end

    subgraph CLOUD["클라우드"]
        direction TB
        SUPA["Supabase Auth<br/>OAuth · 이메일"]
        BE["배포 Backend 〔성주〕<br/>JWKS 검증 · GET /auth/me"]
        ANT["Anthropic API<br/>모델 추론 (사용자 API key)"]
    end

    USER <==> UI
    MAIN ==>|"① OAuth · PKCE<br/>시스템 브라우저"| SUPA
    MAIN ==>|"② cloud client (Bearer)<br/>신원·권한 확인"| BE
    MAIN ==>|"③ sidecar 기동·health<br/>(클라이언트 분리)"| SIDE
    UI ==>|"④ local sidecar client<br/>chat · approve · execution 폴링"| SDK
    SDK <-->|"⑤ 추론"| ANT
    D2M ==>|"⑥ 원본 → 정규화 md"| ROOTS
    WIKI ==>|"⑦ 불변 빌드 · current.json 공개"| ROOTS
    WRITE ==>|"⑧ 승인된 원본 변경<br/>md/txt만 · 바이너리 read-only"| ROOTS
    ROOTS -.->|"⑨ 재변환 → 재빌드 → 새 VERSION"| D2M

    classDef ui fill:#ece8f5,stroke:#6b5ca5,color:#463c6e
    classDef side fill:#f0eefb,stroke:#6b5ca5,color:#3d3560,stroke-width:2px
    classDef write fill:#f7ecdf,stroke:#b96a24,color:#7a4517,stroke-width:2px
    classDef wiki fill:#e3f2ef,stroke:#0e8a7b,color:#0e5a50,stroke-width:2px
    classDef cloud fill:#fdecec,stroke:#c05252,color:#8a3030
    classDef roots fill:#e6edf5,stroke:#3d5a80,color:#27394f
    classDef user fill:#fff,stroke:#888,color:#333

    class USER user
    class UI,MAIN ui
    class SDK side
    class WRITE write
    class WIKI,D2M wiki
    class SUPA,BE,ANT cloud
    class ROOTS roots
